And, playing such wonderful music already is our pianist, Wing-san. Thank you!

187
00:20:46,592 --> 00:20:53,512
そんなウィングさんと一緒に演奏する曲はこちらです。『ポラリスソラリス』
The song we will perform together with Wing-san is this one: "Polaris Solaris".

188
00:21:17,372 --> 00:21:19,152
星の数だけ ほら
Look, as many as the stars,

189
00:21:19,672 --> 00:21:23,572
選択肢があったって story
there were choices, a story.

190
00:21:24,092 --> 00:21:28,992
君の書いた 夢に出会えた キセキ感じて
Feeling the miracle of meeting the dream you wrote,

191
00:21:30,212 --> 00:21:32,212
（北の空）7つの星（輝いて）
(The northern sky) Seven stars (shining bright)

192
00:21:33,192 --> 00:21:38,632
いろんなことがあったよね 立ち止まることだって
We've been through so much, even stopping in our tracks,

193
00:21:38,792 --> 00:21:46,052
それに意味があるって 教えてくれたね
and you taught me that there was meaning in it all.

194
00:21:46,252 --> 00:21:50,692
ポラリス 旅をする者を いつも導いて
Polaris, always guiding travelers on their journey,

195
00:21:51,052 --> 00:21:55,632
私にとって それが君だって 思うよ
I feel that you are that for me.

196
00:21:56,332 --> 00:22:00,952
ポラリス 変わらずにいてね いつも見守って
Polaris, stay as you are, always watching over me,

197
00:22:01,352 --> 00:22:08,612
永遠を信じたいよ 物語
I want to believe in eternity, our story.

198
00:22:22,232 --> 00:22:24,232
神様がくれた
