199
00:22:24,592 --> 00:22:29,812
運命っていう名の story 離れ離れでも
a story called destiny, even if we are apart,

200
00:22:30,412 --> 00:22:34,632
ひとつの奇跡信じて
believing in a single miracle,

201
00:22:35,252 --> 00:22:37,792
高い空 5つの星
high in the sky, five stars

202
00:22:37,892 --> 00:22:42,452
煌めいて
