トキメキは止められないから走ろ!
The excitement is unstoppable, so let's run!

449
00:48:28,772 --> 00:48:32,772
連れていくよ! 光の真ん中 夢の先へ
Lead us away, right into the middle of the light, beyond our dreams!

450
00:48:33,772 --> 00:48:37,772
羽ばたける勇気はキミの願い
The courage to spread our wings is your wish.

451
00:48:38,772 --> 00:48:41,772
皆で繋いだこの奇跡が
This miracle we've all woven together

452
00:48:42,772 --> 00:48:45,772
途切れないように歌うんだ
we'll sing it so it never, ever ends,

453
00:48:46,772 --> 00:48:48,772
もっと高く! 大きな声で
with an even higher, louder voice!

454
00:48:16,772 --> 00:48:54,772
答えとか理屈に惑わされてさまよっても
Even when we get lost in answers and logic,

455
00:48:54,772 --> 00:48:58,772
戻ってこられる場所があったんだ
there was a place we could always return to.

456
00:49:02,772 --> 00:49:06,772
地図にない道ゆく僕らの旅
Our journey goes where no map shows the way,

457
00:49:06,772 --> 00:49:10,772
願いだけが道標だよ
and our only signpost is our wish.

458
00:49:10,772 --> 00:49:15,772
夢の色が変わっても変わらないメロディ
Even if the colors of our dreams change, the melody remains the same.

459
00:49:16,772 --> 00:49:21,772
キミのために僕らのために歌おう!
Let's sing it for you, for us!

460
00:49:22,772 --> 00:49:26,772
そうさきっと! 僕らの奇跡は終わらないよ
Yes, for sure, our miracle will never end!

461
00:49:27,772 --> 00:49:31,772
涙さえキッカケに変えていこう
Let's turn even our tears into our starting point.

462
00:49:32,772 --> 00:49:36,772
信じてくれる仲間と一緒に
Together with friends we can truly believe in,

463
00:49:36,772 --> 00:49:41,772
どこへだって飛び出していこう
let's leap out to anywhere at all!

464
00:49:42,772 --> 00:49:45,772
もっと遠く! 空を越えて
Going further, far beyond the skies!

465
00:49:46,772 --> 00:49:51,772
未来の僕らにまだ見ぬキミに伝えたいこと沢山あるんだ
There is still so much we want to tell our future selves and the "yous" we haven't met yet.

466
00:49:52,772 --> 00:49:55,772
迎えたイマは当たり前なんかじゃない
Welcoming this present moment isn't just something to be expected—

467
00:49:55,772 --> 00:49:59,772
翼を広げさあ今飛ぼう! take my hand!!
so spread your wings and let's fly right now, take my hand!

468
00:50:03,280 --> 00:50:04,880
そうさずっと僕らの奇跡が
Yes, forever, our miracle

469
00:50:05,080 --> 00:50:07,180
途切れないように歌うんだ
will keep singing so it never fades.

470
00:50:07,280 --> 00:50:08,680
もっと高く大きな声で
With a higher, louder voice!

471
00:50:08,880 --> 00:50:12,180
聞こえていた？何かが始まるサイン
Did you hear it? The sign of a new beginning.

472
00:50:41,280 --> 00:50:46,980
未来の僕らにまだ見ぬキミに伝えたいことたくさんあるんだ
We have so much to tell our future selves and you.

473
00:50:50,880 --> 00:50:56,080
迎えたいまは当たり前なんかじゃない翼を広げさあ今飛ぼう
Spread your wings, now let's fly!

474
00:50:56,080 --> 00:50:58,080
飛ぼう
Let's fly!

475
00:51:02,880 --> 00:51:08,580
take my hand 連れていくよ光の真中
Take my hand, I'll lead you to the center of light.

476
00:51:09,080 --> 00:51:12,880
夢の先へ羽ばたける勇気はキミの願い
The courage to soar beyond dreams is your wish.

477
00:51:12,880 --> 00:51:17,880
みんなで繋いだこの奇跡が途切れないように歌うんだ
I'll sing so this miracle we wove never fades.

478
00:51:17,880 --> 00:51:22,080
もっと高く大きな声で
With a higher, louder voice!

479
00:51:22,080 --> 00:51:26,280
ボクらの未来ロードでどこまでも響け
Resound forever down our future road!

480
00:51:59,880 --> 00:52:01,280
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

481
00:52:01,580 --> 00:52:04,880
プリズムメロディでした！
That was "Prism Melody"!

482
00:52:05,080 --> 00:52:10,880
そしてここで、お知らせがあります！
And now, I have an announcement to make!

483
00:52:12,080 --> 00:52:20,580
おお、ありがとうございます！というわけで、そのお知らせがこちらです！
Oh, thank you very much! Here is the announcement!

484
00:52:26,080 --> 00:52:30,080
ときのそら 活動6周年記念グッズが出ます！
Tokino Sora 6th Anniversary goods are out!

485
00:52:33,080 --> 00:52:40,080
いろんなセットがあるので、一つずつ見ていこうと思います。
There are various sets, let's look one by one.

486
00:52:41,080 --> 00:52:50,580
まずはこちら、「そらと一緒に抱き枕カバー」です！
First is the "Dakimakura Cover with Sora".

487
00:53:01,080 --> 00:53:07,080
そして次がこちら、「あんきもスリッパ」です！
And next is the "Ankimo Slippers"!

488
00:53:21,080 --> 00:53:31,080
そしてこちら、シチュエーションボイスです！
And here is the scenario voice.

489
00:53:35,080 --> 00:53:46,080
活動6周年記念フルセットということで、
As for the 6th Anniversary Full Set,

490
00:53:58,080 --> 00:54:16,080
公式ファンクラブのアプリができました！
The official fan club app is now available!

491
00:54:17,080 --> 00:54:23,080
そして最後にお知らせがあります！
And finally, here is an announcement!

492
00:54:23,080 --> 00:54:33,080
本日23時にリハーサル映像がアップされます！
Rehearsal footage will be released tonight at 23:00!

493
00:55:06,730 --> 00:55:10,530
それでは コメントが 見えなくなってしまいましたが
Well, I can't see the comments anymore, but

494
00:55:11,210 --> 00:55:15,230
みんな 喜んでくれてるかな? ありがとうございます。
I wonder if everyone's happy? Thank you very much.

495
00:55:18,410 --> 00:55:24,330
えー、次で最後の曲になります。本当に本当に最後の曲です。
Um, the next song will be the last one. Really, truly the last song.

496
00:55:24,850 --> 00:55:33,610
え、最後の曲も、やっぱり全体曲の中から選ばさせていただきました。
Um, I chose the final song from all the group songs as well.

497
00:55:33,610 --> 00:55:37,610
みんなでパレードをして終わっていきたいよねということで、最後の曲はこちらにしたいと思います。
Since I want us all to finish with a parade, I'd like this to be the last song.

498
00:55:38,310 --> 00:55:41,190
みんなのコメント見えてるよ! ありがとう!
I can see everyone's comments! Thank you!

499
00:55:42,910 --> 00:55:46,730
それでは聴いてください。「Our Bright Parade」！
Now then, please listen to "Our Bright Parade"!

500
00:55:59,668 --> 00:56:04,768
Parade, Parade, Parade! 輝くんだよ
Parade, parade, parade! It's shining bright,

501
00:56:05,268 --> 00:56:10,048
呼び合う声を 合図に
Taking the calling voices as our cue.

502
00:56:12,228 --> 00:56:17,668
Parade, Parade, Parade! 探しに行く
Parade, parade, parade! We're going to search,

503
00:56:18,428 --> 00:56:23,748
スタートは 何度だって
No matter how many times we start anew.

504
00:56:38,688 --> 00:56:43,388
Parade, Parade, Parade! 輝くんだよ
Parade, parade, parade! It's shining bright,

505
00:56:43,588 --> 00:56:48,088
悔しさも 愛しさも 連れておいでよ
Bring along your regrets and your affection too.

506
00:56:48,468 --> 00:56:52,128
ただ 独り言 綴った
I weave lonely words into echoes,

507
00:56:53,088 --> 00:56:57,028
ただ 始まりたくて 走った
I ran because I wanted to begin.

508
00:56:57,528 --> 00:57:01,648
遠く 暗がりに灯った
Far away, a light lit up the darkness,

509
00:57:02,368 --> 00:57:06,208
それは 眩しすぎた名前
It was a name that shone too brightly,

510
00:57:06,848 --> 00:57:10,868
それは 優しすぎる思い出もっと
Memories that are far too gentle,

511
00:57:11,448 --> 00:57:15,988
近づけと 手を伸ばした 思いがけず 結び合った
Reaching out to get closer, unexpectedly we united.

512
00:57:16,528 --> 00:57:20,768
ほら 今 迷子 は “僕 等” に なった
Look, now the lost ones have become "us."

513
00:57:24,388 --> 00:57:29,188
Parade, Parade, Parade! 輝くんだよ
Parade, parade, parade! It's shining bright,

514
00:57:29,528 --> 00:57:33,728
悔しさも 愛しさも 連れておいでよ
Bring along your regrets and your affection too.

515
00:57:34,208 --> 00:57:38,708
風 夢 羽 飛び立てるさ
Wind, dreams, and wings will let you take flight.

516
00:57:39,188 --> 00:57:44,608
ささやかな祈りは 光 終わりなし 兆し
These silent prayers become an endless light and sign.

517
00:57:45,008 --> 00:57:48,708
君を見つけたこと 胸を張れるよ
I can stand tall knowing I found you.

518
00:57:49,248 --> 00:57:53,448
ここから これから Our Bright Parade, Parade!
From here, from now on, our bright parade, parade!

519
00:58:04,888 --> 00:58:08,688
まだ 頼りない予感を
With uncertain feelings still lingering,

520
00:58:09,188 --> 00:58:13,288
歌おう 恥ずかしかなんてないよ
Let's sing—there's nothing to be embarrassed about.

521
00:58:13,888 --> 00:58:18,888
誰も ほどけない イマジナリー
An imaginary world no one can unravel,

522
00:58:19,188 --> 00:58:24,388
いつか また逢える おまじない
A spell to ensure we'll meet again someday.

523
00:58:24,688 --> 00:58:29,888
あの日 ゼロに始まった ストーリー
The story that started from zero on that day,

524
00:58:30,188 --> 00:58:33,688
数え切れない 言葉の葉
Countless leaves of words,

525
00:58:33,688 --> 00:58:37,888
数えるような 想いじゃないさ
Not feelings you can simply count.

526
00:58:38,288 --> 00:58:41,188
ほら 今 “僕 等” を 一つ と 呼ぼう
Look, now let's call "us" one.

527
00:58:41,588 --> 00:58:45,188
Parade, Parade, Parade! 美しいんだよ
Parade, parade, parade! It's all so beautiful,

528
00:58:45,188 --> 00:58:50,388
許し合える 刹那 夜は きらめく
Moments of forgiveness make the night sparkle.

529
00:58:50,588 --> 00:58:54,888
雨、晴れ、カレイド またとない空
Rain, shine, kaleidoscope—a once-in-a-lifetime sky.

530
00:58:55,188 --> 00:58:59,888
相応しい旅路とは 君と在る ことさ
A fitting journey means being right here with you.

531
00:58:59,888 --> 00:59:04,388
君 と 在る こと なんだ
Yes, it means being with you.

532
00:59:04,488 --> 00:59:08,888
「ただいま」を聞けば 「おかえり」って叫ぶよ
When I hear "I'm home," I'll shout "Welcome back."

533
00:59:08,988 --> 00:59:12,888
当たり前じゃないか
Isn't that just natural?

534
00:59:22,788 --> 00:59:27,588
Parade, Parade, Parade! 輝くんだよ
Parade, parade, parade! It's shining bright,

535
00:59:27,888 --> 00:59:33,388
暗がりを満たすのは 君だ 僕だ
Filling the darkness are you and I.

536
00:59:34,888 --> 00:59:39,188
Parade, Parade, Parade! 輝くんだよ
Parade, parade, parade! It's shining bright,

537
00:59:39,388 --> 00:59:44,188
悔しさも 愛しさも 連れておいでよ
Bring along your regrets and your affection too.

538
00:59:44,388 --> 00:59:48,888
風 夢 羽 飛び立てるさ
Wind, dreams, and wings will let you take flight.

539
00:59:49,188 --> 00:59:54,888
ささやかな祈りは 光 終わりなし 兆し
These silent prayers become an endless light and sign.

540
00:59:55,188 --> 00:59:59,888
君と飛び込んでいく 素敵なスタートさ
Diving in together with you—what a wonderful start.

541
01:00:00,188 --> 01:00:03,368
ここから これから Our Bright Parade, Parade!
From here, from now on, our bright parade, parade!

542
01:00:03,896 --> 01:00:06,846
Our Bright Parade, Parade! 輝くんだよ
Our Bright Parade, Parade! Shine bright!

543
01:00:08,296 --> 01:00:11,446
Our Bright Parade, Parade! 輝くんだよ
Our Bright Parade, Parade! Shine bright!

544
01:00:20,396 --> 01:00:22,246
本当に 本当に ありがとうございました！
Thank you so much, truly!

545
01:00:32,196 --> 01:00:34,496
せーのっ！
Ready, go!

546
01:00:37,496 --> 01:00:39,496
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

547
01:00:40,096 --> 01:00:45,196
このあとはアフターパーティーで、会おうねー！
See you at the after-party right after this!

